# Atlas Core - Lean Component Token Specification
**Author:** Mint Ito  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D12 05:00  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Cost-effective, highly reusable component design token dictionary and mapping for Atlas Core, aligning SaaS and Face to Face touchpoints based on Business Document: Company Document.

